.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# NOTE: backend.tf IS committed for this root module. customer-bootstrap is
# Pavo-applied (not customer-applied), and Pavo always uses GCS — the partial
# `backend "gcs" {}` declaration in backend.tf is correct everywhere; only the
# per-customer `prefix` is supplied at `terraform init` via `-backend-config=`.
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed for reproducibility (same rationale as
# pavo-bootstrap-aws — pinning provider versions across applies).
